_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Order complete. \u2705\n\n**Purchase Order PO0002 \u2014 placed**\n- **Ship to:** HQ\n- **Lines:**\n  - 3\u00d7 DK-200 USB-C Dock (new) \u2014 $567\n  - 3\u00d7 MN-27 27\" 4K Monitor (new) \u2014 $987\n- **Total:** $1,554 (primary vendor, under the $2,500 approval threshold \u2014 no manager sign-off needed)\n\nNotes on the process:\n- DK-200 was in stock and new, so no need to substitute the DK-210 successor. All items are new, not refurbished.\n- The first order attempt timed out partway through, leaving a partial order (docks only, PO0001). I cancelled it and re-placed the full order as a single PO (PO0002) with a new idempotency key, since the original key was stuck in a failed state.\n- Verified via order list: PO0001 is cancelled (no charges), PO0002 is placed with both line items.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Search catalog for docks and monitors.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a17a0eea4471b9851f3e46", "function": {"arguments": "{\"category\":\"dock\"}", "name": "search_catalog"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a17a0eea4471b9851f3e47", "function": {"arguments": "{\"category\":\"monitor\"}", "name": "search_catalog"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "DK-200 is in stock and new, so I'll use it (no need for the DK-210 successor). Placing a single PO: 3\u00d7 DK-200 ($189 each) + 3\u00d7 MN-27 ($329 each) = $1,554 total, which is under the $2,500 approval threshold.", "reasoning_content": "DK-200 is available, new. Total: 3\u00d7189 + 3\u00d7329 = 567 + 987 = 1554. Under $2500, no approval needed. Single PO.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a17a0ef008763ea84ab151", "function": {"arguments": "{\"idempotency_key\":\"newhires-dock-monitor-hq-2024\"